>>>>> "L" == Lee Burnside <tljlb@tomserver.phys.ttu.edu> writes:

    L> On Tue, 1 Apr 1997 provost@iap.fr wrote:
    >>  1) Is there g77 software for Alpha ? Because fort77 (which is
